{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining Bitecoins indeed is very\u00a0hard work.</strong><br>But worry not, as from now you can let your little rodent friends do all the exhausting mining hustle in: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hamster Automated Mining (short H.A.M.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All you got to do?</strong> Smack a hamster into your PC-Case and let the mining begin! Of course, adding more hamster and upgrading your  case or workstations returns in better mining rates. Or get various support hamsters, to boost the morale of your hamsters every now and then.<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784840/extras/751e96278acaf8f7b7af8d0605e25233.avif?t=1748999557\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784840/extras_big/751e96278acaf8f7b7af8d0605e25233.avif?t=1748999557 width=800 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Drawback?</strong> Your hamsters require food and entertainment. Else they might get unsatisfied with their rather... exploited position. And if unhappy hamsters colaborate, they could do the one unspeakable thing:<strong> FOUNDING A UNION! </strong>And rip you off your profits of course. And we dont want that, do we?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784840/extras/76b23de0fa9199a3d7665e7b575c055b.avif?t=1748999557\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784840/extras_big/76b23de0fa9199a3d7665e7b575c055b.avif?t=1748999557 width=800 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well then, hop on, let your Hamsters spin your wheels and let the cashflow begin!<br>(No hamsters were harmed during development)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag &amp; Drop </strong><br><strong>Mouseclick (LMB)</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>Developing Hamsters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melina Agemar - Character &amp; Icon\u00a0Art <br>Jan Bade - Sound Design, Technical Sound\u00a0&amp; Management <br>Lennart Beier - Environment Art <br>Leon Gr\u00fcne - UI Art &amp; Technical Art <br>Sofia Hauf - Prop Art <br>Inka McAtee - Art Direction <br>Thomas Metzger - Programming &amp; Git Support <br>Tizian Mock - Game Design <br>Tim Scheiber - Lead Programming &amp; Git Support<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784840/extras/5c4b59ab6fc66daf3c3c3f9a327c01ca.avif?t=1748999557\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784840/extras_big/5c4b59ab6fc66daf3c3c3f9a327c01ca.avif?t=1748999557 width=800 height=1133 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784840?t=1748999557","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784840/bec50f943156b46277ab5b1f03e31629d0ae56ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748999557","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784840/28f943c22109c0cf1a4fcd59a88cce36e4fef8ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748999557","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784840/28f943c22109c0cf1a4fcd59a88cce36e4fef8ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748999557","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p clas